1
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,679
Brother,

2
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,880
Sister Xue's been found.

3
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,719
Hey, Brother Wu.

4
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,360
It's time for us to meet.

5
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,800
All right.

6
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:39,039
Don't bring a crowd.

7
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,960
Snake King only asked for you.

8
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,199
Got it.

9
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,479
Brother Wu.

10
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:54,400
Chenghao.

11
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:54,759
Yeah?

12
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,199
Come with me.

13
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:57,960
I'll get the car.

14
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,840
No need.

15
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:07,080
Brother.

16
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:07,840
Yeah.

17
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:08,680
Where are we going?

18
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,479
Liuli Mansion.

19
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,719
To meet Snake King.

20
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,159
Understood.

21
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:35,919
Brother Wu.

22
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:38,120
I heard about Sister Xue.

23
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:38,800
My condolences.

24
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:39,800
Thanks.

25
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,319
Is he here?

26
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,000
He's inside.

27
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,319
Follow me.

28
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:47,800
Okay.

29
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,000
Stay behind.

30
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,319
Mr. Jing.

31
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,199
You've lost weight.

32
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,079
How is Snake King doing?

33
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:38,079
After that scene you made with Wang Congjun,

34
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,439
do you really think

35
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,079
he's doing fine?

36
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:43,720
Mr. Jing,

37
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:46,240
Brother Jun and Brother Wu usually

38
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,160
just have minor disagreements.

39
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:50,759
If they sit down and talk it through,

40
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,519
won't everything be fine?

41
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,439
Is that so?

42
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:59,199
Sounds like you know better than Snake King.

43
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,480
Ah...

44
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,199
I spoke out of turn.

45
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,800
I'll take a drink to apologize.

46
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,920
Actually, I don't think

47
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,040
what happened at the docks

48
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,279
was Wang Congjun's doing.

49
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,519
I also heard Xiaoxue met with foul play,

50
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,639
and what's more,

51
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,360
her remains are incomplete.

52
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:29,959
Do you think Wang Congjun did that too?

53
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:31,959
We've fought openly and in secret for years,

54
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,920
but all we fought over

55
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,040
was strictly business.

56
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:37,920
We never dragged family into it.

57
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:39,600
I don't think

58
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,680
he would take things

59
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,480
this far.

60
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,959
Old Wu, you've changed.

61
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:52,759
You've gotten

62
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,079
soft.

63
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,639
Mr. Jing,

64
00:05:58,759 --> 00:06:00,079
if Snake King

65
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,040
were worried about our conflict,

66
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:06,319
he should've invited both of us today.

67
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,160
Why

68
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,199
meet with only me?

69
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,959
Snake King's mindset hasn't changed.

70
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:18,439
Whoever proves their capability to him

71
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,560
is the one he'll hand

72
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,560
the Black Snake Syndicate to.

73
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,759
But

74
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,240
I think

75
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,160
he's leaning toward you.

76
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,319
Oh?

77
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:35,959
Well, my thanks to Snake King, then.

78
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:36,759
But

79
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,560
Snake King will always be my big brother.

80
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,079
I've never thought

81
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,360
of taking his place.

82
00:06:48,959 --> 00:06:49,800
Old Wu,

83
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,000
In this game, your life isn't your own.

84
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,120
It's time to change your rules.

85
00:06:57,800 --> 00:07:00,120
Hand over your shipping route

86
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,920
for the Syndicate to traffic drugs,

87
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,639
and the title of Snake King

88
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,560
will surely be yours.

89
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,079
Mr. Jing,

90
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,759
we've known each other for years.

91
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:21,519
I don't mince words.

92
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,680
Xiaoxue was murdered.

93
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:25,519
Right now, my entire focus

94
00:07:25,759 --> 00:07:27,720
is on finding her killer.

95
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,639
As for anything else,

96
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,920
I really don't have the energy for it.

97
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:46,000
If Snake King were to see

98
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
the look on your face right now,

99
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,839
imagine how disappointed he'd be.

100
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,319
I've said all I have to say.

101
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,839
What you do now

102
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,360
is up to you.

103
00:08:13,079 --> 00:08:14,600
What happened to Xiaoxue

104
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:16,279
must be investigated.

105
00:08:20,199 --> 00:08:22,360
But keep an eye on the people around you.

106
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:50,799
Chenghao.

107
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:52,320
Tomorrow, take Qingqing

108
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,679
to her grandmother's.

109
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,559
It's too dangerous right now.

110
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:58,039
Escort her yourself.

111
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:00,919
Remember,

112
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,480
this

113
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,879
is extremely important.

114
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,639
Understood.

115
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,000
Captain Liao.

116
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:20,759
Yeah?

117
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,120
Wang Congjun is dead.

118
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,840
What?

119
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,240
We responded immediately after getting the call.

120
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:30,000
The scene is a sauna room at a bathhouse.

121
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,559
Wang Congjun's throat was slit.

122
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:32,879
It was done with extreme precision.

123
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,080
Brother.

124
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,320
Wang Congjun is dead.

125
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,320
At the bathhouse.

126
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,919
His throat was slit.

127
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,759
We've examined the scene,

128
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:51,720
but found no useful evidence.

129
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,399
The cameras inside the bathhouse

130
00:09:53,399 --> 00:09:54,440
were intentionally disabled,

131
00:09:54,799 --> 00:09:55,960
and exterior cameras didn't capture

132
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,519
anyone suspicious entering.

133
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,399
We questioned Wang Congjun's men.

134
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:01,919
They were deliberately lured away beforehand,

135
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,360
so they had no contact with the killer.

136
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,240
Brother Wu,

137
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,159
now that Wang Congjun is dead,

138
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:10,679
they're bound to suspect us first.

139
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,000
We definitely need to get ready.

140
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,879
What do you know?

141
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:20,960
We didn't do it.

142
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,480
What's there to prepare for?

143
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,240
Besides,

144
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,080
I've wanted to take those bastards down anyway.

145
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,919
Things are getting lively.

146
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,639
Ah Tang,

147
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:36,519
send more men.

148
00:10:36,879 --> 00:10:38,919
Watch all our spots at the docks.

149
00:10:39,519 --> 00:10:40,039
Yes, sir.

150
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,159
As for you,

151
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:47,840
stay here for now.

152
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,919
I'm going to check on Qingqing.

153
00:10:48,919 --> 00:10:49,519
Got it.

154
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:12,120
Why do I have to go to Grandma's today?

155
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,639
It's not even the weekend. I'm not going!

156
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,840
Qingqing,

157
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,519
Daddy will come pick you up in a couple of days.

158
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:21,799
I don't want you to pick me up. I want Mom!

159
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,639
I haven't seen Mom in such a long time.

160
00:11:32,399 --> 00:11:35,080
Uncle Tang, I don't want to go to Grandma's.

161
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,120
Why don't you want to go to Grandma's, Qingqing?

162
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,519
Grandma misses you. Don't you miss her?

163
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,759
Qingqing.

164
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:46,000
Daddy has something for you.

165
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:47,600
Look.

166
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:49,639
Isn't it pretty?

167
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,480
Here, let Daddy put it on you.

168
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,919
Qingqing, listen to your uncle, okay?

169
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,159
Go on, off you go.

170
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:13,759
Qingqing.

171
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,159
Say goodbye to Daddy.

172
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,399
Come on, into the car.

173
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:25,519
Here we go, one, two, three.

174
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:28,720
Let's get your seatbelt on.

175
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:33,559
Off we go.

176
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,360
Round up more guys

177
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:05,159
and head to Qingxi Market.

178
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,559
If you get any news,

179
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,159
contact me directly.

180
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:13,720
Whatever it takes,

181
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:16,759
dig up that killer for me.

182
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,159
Don't worry, Brother Wu.

183
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:20,440
Hello, Mr. Jing.

184
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,559
Here's 200,000 dollars.

185
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:36,720
The balance...

186
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,320
you'll get once it's done.

187
00:14:43,399 --> 00:14:43,919
Go.

188
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:59,720
Today's class is landscape sketching.

189
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,960
Keep two things in mind.

190
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,840
First is capturing each object's

191
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:05,159
form, contour, and structure.

192
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:09,720
And second...

193
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:13,240
Second is the integrity of the overall composition.

194
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,799
Let's get started, everyone. Go ahead.

195
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,639
Follow the structure of this tree...

196
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,440
I'll get going now, Auntie.

197
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,240
Drive safe, okay?

198
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:48,840
Will do.

199
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,840
Uncle Tang.

200
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:53,759
Yeah?

201
00:15:54,639 --> 00:15:56,039
I'll tell you a secret.

202
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,080
What is it?

203
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:59,039
Sister Jingya told me...

204
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:00,440
she likes you.

205
00:16:08,399 --> 00:16:09,200
What are you talking about?

206
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,080
Bye then!

207
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:12,679
Bye.

208
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,080
Hello?

209
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:37,279
Two people are following me at the park.

210
00:16:37,279 --> 00:16:37,919
I'm in the public restroom.

211
00:16:37,919 --> 00:16:38,879
Who's following you?

212
00:16:39,639 --> 00:16:40,159
Hello?

213
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:41,480
Hello?

214
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,319
Excuse me.

215
00:17:05,759 --> 00:17:06,240
Jingya.

216
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,640
Jingya.

217
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:08,680
Jingya!

218
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:20,519
Hello?

219
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,079
Jingya?

220
00:17:21,079 --> 00:17:22,359
I'm at the park. Where are you?

221
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,400
I have your girlfriend.

222
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:28,880
Bring the stuff over.

223
00:17:31,319 --> 00:17:31,920
Where?

224
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:33,839
I'll send you the location.

225
00:18:26,559 --> 00:18:27,440
Brother Tang

226
00:20:08,279 --> 00:20:09,119
Brother,

227
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,920
we found Sister Xue.

228
00:20:28,319 --> 00:20:29,119
Boss.

229
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,880
Brother Wu.

230
00:20:59,079 --> 00:20:59,880
Bro.

231
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:01,960
What's wrong?

232
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,119
Out of the way!

233
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,880
Move!

234
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:23,880
Xiaoxue

235
00:21:40,519 --> 00:21:41,359
Does it look good?

236
00:21:51,559 --> 00:21:53,279
All of you, get out.

237
00:21:53,279 --> 00:21:54,440
Lock the door.

238
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,279
Don't come in unless I call you.

239
00:21:58,799 --> 00:21:59,240
Brother.

240
00:21:59,240 --> 00:21:59,880
Keep a close eye out.

241
00:22:00,279 --> 00:22:01,200
Don't let anyone in.

242
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,839
Brother, a group just showed up at the docks.

243
00:22:03,839 --> 00:22:05,039
They don't look like Wang Congjun's men.

244
00:22:33,759 --> 00:22:34,240
Brother!

245
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:36,000
Don't worry about me!

246
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:37,240
Kill him!

247
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:38,480
Shut up!

248
00:22:43,759 --> 00:22:44,559
Mr. Tang.

249
00:22:45,799 --> 00:22:46,720
You don't have to do this.

250
00:22:47,559 --> 00:22:49,119
All I want is what you have.

251
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,079
I'm asking you, where is she?

252
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:54,960
Mr. Tang...

253
00:22:56,079 --> 00:22:57,160
Let my brother go.

254
00:22:58,039 --> 00:22:59,000
Give me the goods,

255
00:22:59,799 --> 00:23:00,920
and you can leave.

256
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,480
Fine.

257
00:23:02,839 --> 00:23:04,799
You get the goods, I get her.

258
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:40,160
Brother Hao.

259
00:23:40,799 --> 00:23:41,440
Let her go.

260
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:45,039
Let her go!

261
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,079
Let her go!

262
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,480
Jingya.

263
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:53,519
Jingya!

264
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,000
Get up.

265
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:57,119
Brother Hao.

266
00:23:57,519 --> 00:23:58,319
Get up, hurry!

267
00:24:04,519 --> 00:24:05,000
Run!

268
00:24:21,319 --> 00:24:21,880
Brother Hao!

269
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,160
Forget me! Save Jingya!

270
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,200
Jingya.

271
00:24:57,039 --> 00:24:57,680
Jingya.

272
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:00,599
Jingya.

273
00:25:01,319 --> 00:25:01,720
Jingya.

274
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:05,880
Captain Liao.

275
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,480
Yeah?

276
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,880
Regarding those identical delivery boxes

277
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:09,960
found earlier at suspect Zhang Maomao's place,

278
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,920
we contacted the senders and found out

279
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:13,799
that he purchased formalin.

280
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:16,440
Aside from preserving corpses,

281
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,640
the most common use for formalin

282
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,680
is for shady vendors to soak seafood in.

283
00:25:20,839 --> 00:25:21,400
But

284
00:25:21,759 --> 00:25:23,319
he's just a cleaner.

285
00:25:23,319 --> 00:25:25,119
Logically, he shouldn't need this stuff.

286
00:25:26,119 --> 00:25:27,400
Which means this formalin

287
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,960
was most likely bought for someone else.

288
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:32,359
Everyone, check the local markets immediately.

289
00:25:32,359 --> 00:25:33,079
Yes, sir.

290
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:42,960
Can you stand up?

291
00:25:55,279 --> 00:25:56,200
Tell me,

292
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,799
why?

293
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:01,559
My mom said

294
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:03,559
mermaids are real.

295
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,880
My mom wouldn't lie to me.

296
00:26:12,599 --> 00:26:13,559
Look.

297
00:27:44,640 --> 00:27:45,440
Huang Lun

298
00:28:16,079 --> 00:28:17,160
Doctor, how is he?

299
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:19,640
The patient's vitals are stable.

300
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,440
He'll be transferred to

301
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:21,079
the ICU

302
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:22,039
for observation shortly.

303
00:28:23,519 --> 00:28:24,680
What about your injuries?

304
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:28,599
We're fine. Thank you.

305
00:28:28,599 --> 00:28:29,480
Thank you.

306
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:32,920
Brother Hao,

307
00:28:33,279 --> 00:28:34,720
don't worry too much.

308
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:45,759
Wang Huo.

309
00:28:46,359 --> 00:28:48,079
It's getting late. Your brother's probably waiting for you.

310
00:28:48,079 --> 00:28:49,039
Head on home.

311
00:28:49,599 --> 00:28:50,920
Appreciate it.

312
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:51,559
All right.

313
00:28:52,039 --> 00:28:53,160
Call me if you need anything.

314
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:53,920
Will do.

315
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:56,079
Thanks.

316
00:29:08,440 --> 00:29:09,200
Brother Wu.

317
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:16,279
Beautiful.

318
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:20,880
Simply beautiful.

319
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,720
I told you making it with Sister Xue

320
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:29,599
would be way better than the trash he made before.

321
00:29:40,359 --> 00:29:41,440
Much better.

322
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:45,799
You did a fine job.

323
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:48,720
An artist.

324
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:56,440
Don't worry, Brother Wu.

325
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:01,599
Your death will be far more spectacular than hers.

326
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,160
Mr. Tang.

327
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,279
You don't have to do this.

328
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,640
I just want what's yours.

329
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:34,079
How did it go?

330
00:30:38,799 --> 00:30:40,000
Not great.

331
00:30:43,039 --> 00:30:43,920
Brother Hao.

332
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,279
It really is you.

333
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,519
It really is you.

334
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,920
Let me play you something.

335
00:31:03,599 --> 00:31:05,920
What the hell do you want?

336
00:31:08,599 --> 00:31:10,000
Brother Hao, you know the place.

337
00:31:10,599 --> 00:31:11,559
Bring the goods

338
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:12,880
and come over.

339
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,000
I'll be waiting.
